:: day0_moonspire_lower [nobr]
<<locationImage "moonspire_tower" "Moonspire Tower">>
<h2>🌙 Moonspire Tower   Lower Levels</h2>
<p>Accessible via the service stair, not the bridge. The preparations are underway.</p>

<<if $d1_npc_nara and not $d0_npc_nara2>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "nara" "Nara">>
  <h4>🕯 Nara on the Stairs</h4>
  <p>Carrying candles   an armful of white wax pillars she's struggling to balance.</p>
  [[Approach|day0_npc_nara2]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if not $d0_npc_vael2>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "vael" "Mistress Vael">>
  <h4>⚗ The Potion Is Ready</h4>
  <p>The Apothecary smells different today. A single dominant aroma   silver and cold and floral.</p>
  [[Enter|day0_npc_vael2]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if (not $d1_npc_nara or $d0_npc_nara2) and $d0_npc_vael2>>
  <p class="empty-note">The lower levels have gone quiet. Everything the tower needed to tell you, it's told you.</p>
<</if>>

<div class="nav-return">
  [[← Return to Palace Hub|day0_hub]]
</div>
